OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with further showers, heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes particularly over the Pennines,
OL,8,Fthrough the evening and into Saturday.
OL,9,FRemaining windy through the night,
OL,10,Fwith strong gusts around the coasts
OL,11,Fand hills. A more widely cool night
OL,12,Fthan last night.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSaturday:FRemaining partly cloudy with
OL,15,Fshowers, heavy at times. Fresh to
OL,16,Fstrong winds, gusty around the coasts
OL,17,Fand hills. Showers and winds ease by
OL,18,Fthe evening. Feeling cool.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
